    "name": "Transformer \u2014 Attention Is All You Need",
    "description": "Original encoder-decoder Transformer (Vaswani et al., 2017), base config: d_model=512, 8 heads, d_ff=2048, dropout 0.1, shared 37k-token embedding (via shared_id, as in the paper). One encoder and one decoder layer shown expanded; the paper stacks N=6 of each. Not expressible as graph nodes: sinusoidal positional encoding, the causal decoder mask, and the sqrt(d_model) embedding scale - add those in code for real training.",
    "author": "Nasser Obeid"
  },
